    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφημερ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep guard by day</i>, <i><span class="en">
