				21.27.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				1.817
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Callipolis</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τῶν πυλῶν</span>”
