				of service</i> in the temple, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				7.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφημερία</span>.</div>
